          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What fabric options do you offer for tank tops?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We offer cotton jersey for natural comfort (140-180 GSM), bamboo for sustainable softness (140-160 GSM), modal for luxurious drape (150-180 GSM), polyester for durability and cost efficiency (140-180 GSM), and rayon blends for fluid movement (150-190 GSM). All fabrics are pre-shrunk to minimize dimensional changes after washing. Fabric selection depends on climate, season, intended use, and brand positioning, with lighter weights for summer and heavier weights for year-round wear."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What tank top styles can you manufacture?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We manufacture basic tank tops with standard armholes and neckline for versatile wear, racerback tank tops with athletic back styling for activewear, muscle tank tops with wider armholes for casual styling, flowy tank tops with relaxed drape for feminine appeal, and cropped tank tops for contemporary fashion. All styles can be customized with neckline variations, hem finishes, and trim options. Custom style development is available with technical specifications."
          }
        },
