          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We offer organic cotton jersey certified by GOTS for natural fiber sustainability, bamboo fabrics certified by FSC for responsible sourcing, and modal produced from sustainably managed beech wood forests. All eco-friendly options maintain the same quality standards as conventional fabrics. Organic cotton costs approximately 15-20% more than conventional cotton, while bamboo and modal are priced 10-15% above standard cotton jersey. Certification documentation is provided for marketing substantiation."
          }
        },
