          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does tank top production take?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Standard production timeline is 30-40 days from fabric receipt for basic tank tops. Custom fabric development adds 15-20 days. Sampling takes 15-20 days before bulk production approval. Complex styles such as racerback or flowy designs may require 35-45 days production time. We recommend planning 60-75 days total from initial inquiry to delivery for first-time orders including sampling and production, or 45-60 days for repeat orders using approved fabrics and patterns."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can you produce tank tops with custom neckline and hem finishes?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We offer crew neck, scoop neck, V-neck, and boat neck neckline options. Hem finishes include standard folded hem, raw hem for casual styling, ribbed trim for sport aesthetic, and lace trim for feminine detail. Custom neckline depths and hem widths are available with technical specifications. Complex finishes such as lace trim or raw hem may increase minimum order quantities to 500 pieces due to production complexity. We can provide guidance on finish combinations that balance aesthetics with manufacturing efficiency."
          }
