      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What is the minimum order quantity for tank tops?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Our minimum order quantity for custom tank tops is 300 pieces per style. This minimum allows you to access factory-direct pricing while testing market response with manageable inventory. The 300-piece minimum can be distributed across sizes within a single colorway. Lower quantities are available for sampling and prototype development at higher per-piece costs for brands requiring smaller initial runs or needing to test multiple styles before committing to bulk production.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What fabric options do you offer for tank tops?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">We offer cotton jersey for natural comfort (140-180 GSM), bamboo for sustainable softness (140-160 GSM), modal for luxurious drape (150-180 GSM), polyester for durability and cost efficiency (140-180 GSM), and rayon blends for fluid movement (150-190 GSM). All fabrics are pre-shrunk to minimize dimensional changes after washing. Fabric selection depends on climate, season, intended use, and brand positioning, with lighter weights for summer and heavier weights for year-round wear.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What tank top styles can you manufacture?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">We manufacture basic tank tops with standard armholes and neckline for versatile wear, racerback tank tops with athletic back styling for activewear, muscle tank tops with wider armholes for casual styling, flowy tank tops with relaxed drape for feminine appeal, and cropped tank tops for contemporary fashion. All styles can be customized with neckline variations, hem finishes, and trim options. Custom style development is available with technical specifications.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Do you offer eco-friendly tank top options?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Yes. We offer organic cotton jersey certified by GOTS for natural fiber sustainability, bamboo fabrics certified by FSC for responsible sourcing, and modal produced from sustainably managed beech wood forests. All eco-friendly options maintain the same quality standards as conventional fabrics. Organic cotton costs approximately 15-20% more than conventional cotton, while bamboo and modal are priced 10-15% above standard cotton jersey. Certification documentation is provided for marketing substantiation.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">How long does tank top production take?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Standard production timeline is 30-40 days from fabric receipt for basic tank tops. Custom fabric development adds 15-20 days. Sampling takes 15-20 days before bulk production approval. Complex styles such as racerback or flowy designs may require 35-45 days production time. We recommend planning 60-75 days total from initial inquiry to delivery for first-time orders including sampling and production, or 45-60 days for repeat orders using approved fabrics and patterns.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Can you produce tank tops with custom neckline and hem finishes?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Yes. We offer crew neck, scoop neck, V-neck, and boat neck neckline options. Hem finishes include standard folded hem, raw hem for casual styling, ribbed trim for sport aesthetic, and lace trim for feminine detail. Custom neckline depths and hem widths are available with technical specifications. Complex finishes such as lace trim or raw hem may increase minimum order quantities to 500 pieces due to production complexity. We can provide guidance on finish combinations that balance aesthetics with manufacturing efficiency.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
